The **Executions** tab of the `agent` function shows each part of a request: a short `POST /runs` execution that queues the request, a longer `POST /drain` execution that runs the agent, and a `schedule` execution every five minutes.

# Extend the agent

To give the agent a new ability, add a tool that writes rows. The presence and Realtime code stay the same. Keep each tool narrow, and check every argument in the function.

